[Bbm]and [Eb/Bb]died [Ab]on [Eb/G]earth [Cm]that [Ab]we might [Eb/Bb]live [Bbm]above.

Verse 3:
[Ab]Give of [Bbm]thine [Cm]own [Eb7/Bb]to [Ab]bear the message [Eb7]glorious;
